		"description": {
			"baseEffect": "<p><strong>Cantrip · 1 Action.</strong></p><p>Summon 1 adjacent Shadow (a d12 minion).</p><p><strong>Minions.</strong> They follow the minion rules (1 HP, no damage bonus, do not crit) and abandon you immediately outside of combat.</p><p><strong>Shadow Limit.</strong> You can have up to INT Shadows.</p><p>Command them with the <strong>Command Shadows</strong> cantrip.</p><p>[A] Casting summons the Shadows beside you, up to your Shadow Limit, and they vanish when combat ends.</p>",
